{comment: Intro}
| [Bb] | [Eb] | [Gm7] | [Eb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
E[Bb]lijah was a man just like us [Eb]
[Gm7]He prayed earnestly to the [Eb]Lord
That [Gm7]it would [F/A]not rain on the [Eb]land
No [Gm7]rain fell for three [F/A]and a half [Bb]years
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
