The earth [Eb]produced its har[Bb]vest [Gm7]now
Power [F]of prayer is seen to[Bb]day
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Instrumental}
| [Bb] | [Eb] | [Gm7] | [Eb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
A [Bb]human being [F/A]just like us [Eb]
